+```
+
+### 6. Mutation self-check (sha256 `4fe1c61aae279ee3338722589b45dec9a72d1bd40c7ad93174f970d5b88ce171`)
+
+Mutant 1 (removed `"survive": mutant["survive"] is not None` from `mutant_key_part`): `tests/test_mutation_run.py::test_r041_done_c_survive_flag_change_reruns` failed; restored; sha256 matched.
