+Install-stamp / MANIFEST failures (expected until the supervisor regenerates `MANIFEST.json`): failures and errors under `tests/test_install_check.py`, `tests/test_rollback.py`, and `tests/test_core_carve.py::test_r003_the_modules_install_from_the_manifest` citing `cursor-bridge/mutation-run.py (not in the manifest)`.
