+Fix the following confirmed defect: repair the named cause, nothing else. This increment is past the owner's three-round review ceiling, and the supervisor's by-class line covers the configuration subsystem only. This item is outside that line and in the blocking classes: a failing test (CI's Windows job on PR #91, run 40494978032) and data integrity (a mutant's result that is not the result of the mutated bytes), confirmed by reproduction. Every finding recorded in `docs/HARDENING.md` under TASK-031 stays there and is not yours to fix.
