+**Reproduction test (red on round 13's code; must pass).** In `tests/test_mutation_run_supervisor.py`: `test_task031_r14_a_tracked_pyc_the_tests_read_stays_in_the_copy`. Today it fails with `equiv: killed (ran)`, exit 0; it expects `survived`, exit 1.
